      "writtenOn": "2023-01-13T14:06:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We do need both. In current design, libs_to_trim will be specified by apex soong module. it is always there, regardless if we are building static or trimmed apexes. so checking if libs_to_trim is empty will not work, it is always not empty. The boolean \u0027trim\u0027 however gives us a way to turn trimmed build on or off. Module authors never need to set it explicitly in their apex soong module. Rather it is in a default, refer to aosp/2384532, it is set to true or false depends on a soong configure variable. This soong configure variable is them controlled by the existence of an environment variable (refer to aosp/2384472). So we can turn on or off trimmed build by setting or unsetting this environment variable.",
      "parentUuid": "f569ddcd_efe9d43c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 393,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 397,
        "endChar": 22
      },
